p with her, and he’s Yong Ze's best friend, Lan Tian. The boys then begin to compete in every aspect of life, from love to career. They train strictly for their upcoming national swimming competition, and before the battle begins, Lan Tian's father threatens Yong Zhe into losing the competition. To uphold justice and maintain honor and sportsmanship, Lan Tian defends Yong Zhe and restores his reputation. Through many twists and turns, the three youths build a a sense of responsibility and perseverance, releasing an inner shine of outstanding youths.","rating":{"sources":[{"title":"IMDb","logo":"https://a7.pnghunt.com/preview/450/662/555/computer-wallpaper-text-brand-yellow-imdb.jpg","max_value":10,"value":8}],"value":8,"age":"R"},"current_season_id":7135,"content_control":"NORMAL"}}